# Quant Portfolio Risk

Read `SKILL.md` before making changes. Start with the mandate and risk budget; keep hard limits testable; distinguish targets, orders, fills, and accounting positions; and fail closed on missing or stale risk inputs. Include costs, liquidity, stress, governance, and reconciliation checks.

Default to analysis, simulation, or paper trading. Do not alter broker or account state, promise returns, or present output as personalized investment advice.
